Full rule: see `AGENTS.md` § Component Conventions and § Accessibility.

When editing a component in this scope:

- Props are an explicit `interface`; destructure in the signature; never `props: any`.
- One **named** export per file — no barrel `index.ts` for components.
- Buttons need an explicit `type`; images need `alt` (or `alt="" aria-hidden`).
- User-facing text is a key in `src/i18n/locales/<lng>/common.json`, read via
  `useTranslation()`'s `t('KEY')` — never hardcoded in JSX.
- Tailwind design tokens only — no arbitrary values like `w-[127px]`.
